            "detailed_description": "Pointless is a game about destroying Dots. Each Dot you destroy adds one point to your score. You can add your score to a global point pool, and see how many Dots have been destroyed globally. Rad!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dot destroying action.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Five different weapons; Laser, Pulse, Wide, Bomb and Chain. Destroy thousands of Dots!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A Global count of all Dots destroyed, using the magic of the internet.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Eleven unlockable palettes, destroy Dots to any colour.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Alex, they're literally a talking head. Can you find a way to be attached? Character building!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An authentic Retro Game Gal aesthetic, right down to that 160*144 pixel screen.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam Achievements, show off your Dot destroying skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam Trading Cards, you'll have to earn those badges!</li></ul>",
