                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It has no sense of accomplishment and it is extremely basic. If you want an incremental clicker there are tons more out there that are way better.\n\nI can imagine a kid enjoying this for a short while to quell boredom as a pocket game in the 90s, only to be quickly forgotten in a drawer somewhere.\n\nIt offers nothing worth your time in this day and age on your computer. Clickers can be fun, but we've come much further in what they can offer you now in terms of a sense of accomplishments and incremental building of satisfaction & power in the game.",
